<title>UK: One 2 One names new finance director.</title>
<headline>One 2 One names new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British mobile phone company One 2 One, a joint venture between Cable and Wireless Plc and U.S. West Inc, said on Wednesday it had appointed Bob Koenig as its new finance director.</p>
<p>Koenig, 48, replaces Dick Foy who is leaving One 2 One to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Koenig is currently the vice president and chief financial officer at U.S. West's New Vector division.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
